(   It finds existing accessible files, not deleted bytes; identity and archive) Tj T*
(   coverage may remain uncertain. Byte equality does not prove application repair.) Tj T*
(   UGREEN expert results, data handling, gateway approvals and collision guarantees) Tj T*
(   remain unknown. Stop when safety is not established.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
